codex
The pinned binaries expose a container PID-namespace mismatch: Lean asks for `/proc/<namespace-pid>/exe`, while this sandbox’s `/proc` is indexed by host PIDs. I’ve isolated that cause and am applying a narrow read-only launcher shim that redirects only that executable-path lookup to `/proc/self/exe`; then I’ll rerun the unchanged trusted checker.
